(Statement of Work - Patient Reminder Service) Tj T*
(Client: Bluebird Dental Clinics AB) Tj T*
(Supplier: Maya Lindqvist Consulting) Tj T*
(Date: 2 November 2025 \(final\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Background) Tj T*
(Bluebird Dental Clinics operates four clinics in Uppsala and Enkoping. About 18% of) Tj T*
(booked appointments are missed without notice, which costs the clinics an estimated EUR) Tj T*
(210,000 a year in idle chair time.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Service) Tj T*
(A patient reminder service that sends reminders 48 hours before each appointment by SMS) Tj T*
(and email, with a link to confirm or cancel. A second, SMS-only reminder is sent 2 hours) Tj T*
(before the appointment.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Deliverables) Tj T*
(- A reminder scheduler connected to the clinics' DentaBook booking system.) Tj T*
(- Message templates in English and Swedish.) Tj T*
(- An opt-out page for patients who do not want reminders.) Tj T*
(- A monthly report of no-show rates per clinic.) Tj T*
(- Handover documentation and one training session for reception staff.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Roles and responsibilities) Tj T*
(Bluebird provides API access to DentaBook, a test clinic and one contact person in each) Tj T*
(clinic. The Supplier designs, builds and configures the service and supports reception) Tj T*
(staff during the first two weeks.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Commercial terms) Tj T*
(Fixed price of EUR 9,500, payable in two equal instalments: half on kickoff and half on) Tj T*
(acceptance. Support after go-live is billed at EUR 95 per hour. SMS costs are passed) Tj T*
(through at cost.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Acceptance) Tj T*
(The Client confirms acceptance within 10 business days of go-live. If the Client raises) Tj T*
(no defects in that period, the service counts as accepted.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Data protection) Tj T*
(Patient names, phone numbers and appointment times are processed under the data) Tj T*
(processing agreement signed on 28 October 2025. Message logs are deleted after 90 days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Timeline) Tj T*
(Kickoff on 10 November 2025. Go-live on 12 January 2026.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Change requests) Tj T*
(Changes to scope are estimated in hours and approved by email before work starts.) Tj T*
